      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Install **Kandinsky S2V** (`kandinsky-s2v`) in Manager; restart.\n\nClick **Download models** below (or the **Kandinsky S2V** menu). Downloads the Pro distilled DiT, the HunyuanVideo VAE, CLIP-L and Qwen2.5-Omni-7B: about 66 GB, 43 GB of it the Pro DiT and 22 GB Qwen.\n\nPick a reference image in **Load Image** and a speech track in **Load Audio**. The prompt describes the scene; the lip-sync follows the audio. `chunks = 0` covers the whole track, up to 300 s.\n\nDefault: **Pro distilled, 16 π-Flow steps per 5-second chunk**. Guidance is distilled into the model: no negative prompt, no CFG.\n\nComfyUI **0.38+** required. For gated/private HF weights, run `hf auth login` on the server."
      ],
      "title": "Models",
